<TimeML xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="TimeML_1.2.1.xsd">
  <DOCID>begona</DOCID>
  <TIMEX3 tid="t0" type="DATE" value="2015-10-02T00:00:00" functionInDocument="CREATION_TIME" temporalFunction="false">2015-10-02</TIMEX3>
  <TEXT><EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE">KONTSULTAREN</EVENT> ARRAZOIA: <EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE">Sinkopea</EVENT>&#13;
<EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE">AURREKARI</EVENT> PERTSONALAK&#13;
85 urtetako emakumea. &#13;
Ez du <EVENT eid="e4" class="REPORTING">adierazi</EVENT> medikamentuekiko <EVENT eid="e5" class="OCCURRENCE">alergia</EVENT> ezagunik duenik. &#13;
Arrisku kardiobaskularreko <EVENT eid="e6" class="OCCURRENCE">faktoreak</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e7" class="OCCURRENCE">hipertentsio</EVENT> arteriala, <EVENT eid="e8" class="OCCURRENCE">diabetes</EVENT> mellitusa eta <EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE">hiperkolesterolemia</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e10" class="OCCURRENCE">Aurrekari</EVENT> ez-kardiologikoak: Biriketako <EVENT eid="e11" class="STATE">butxadura</EVENT> kroniko larria. &#13;
Endokrinologiak <EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE">jarraitzen</EVENT> duen <EVENT eid="e13" class="STATE">hipertiroidismo</EVENT> subklinikoa. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e14" class="STATE">Artritis</EVENT> erreumatikoa. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e15" class="OCCURRENCE">Kirurgia</EVENT> baten ondorengo sakoneko zainen <EVENT eid="e16" class="OCCURRENCE">tronbosia</EVENT> eta birika <EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE">enbolismoa</EVENT>. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e18" class="OCCURRENCE">Depresioa</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e19" class="OCCURRENCE">Aurrekari</EVENT> kardiologikoak: <EVENT eid="e20" class="OCCURRENCE">Kardiopatia</EVENT> iskemiko kronikoa, kardiologiako kontsulta anbulatorioen <EVENT eid="e21" class="OCCURRENCE">kontrolpean</EVENT>. &#13;
Esfortzuko <EVENT eid="e22" class="OCCURRENCE">angina</EVENT>, esfortzu <EVENT eid="e23" class="OCCURRENCE">froga</EVENT> positiboarekin <TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DATE" value="2006" temporalFunction="false">2006an</TIMEX3>. &#13;
Bihotzeko arteria koronarioen hainbat <EVENT eid="e24" class="OCCURRENCE">kateterismo</EVENT> egin zaizkio: <TIMEX3 tid="t2" type="DATE" value="2006" temporalFunction="false">2006an</TIMEX3> ezker enborreko arteria nagusien <EVENT eid="e25" class="OCCURRENCE">butxadura</EVENT> larriagatik 2 <EVENT eid="e26" class="OCCURRENCE">stent</EVENT> jarri zitzaizkion. &#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t3" type="DATE" value="2007" temporalFunction="false">2007an</TIMEX3> eskuin arteria koronarioaren <EVENT eid="e27" class="OCCURRENCE">butxadura</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e28" class="REPORTING">ikusi</EVENT> zen, baina neurri txikiko arteria zenez ez zer ezer <EVENT eid="e29" class="OCCURRENCE">egin</EVENT>. &#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t4" type="DATE" value="2011" temporalFunction="false">2011an</TIMEX3> ez da <EVENT eid="e30" class="OCCURRENCE">butxadura</EVENT> berririk <EVENT eid="e31" class="REPORTING">ikusten</EVENT> eta aurretik ezarritako stent-en <EVENT eid="e32" class="OCCURRENCE">egoera</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e33" class="OCCURRENCE">egokia</EVENT> da. &#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t5" type="DATE" value="2013" temporalFunction="false">2013an</TIMEX3> eginiko azkeneko bihotzeko <EVENT eid="e34" class="OCCURRENCE">ekokardiogramaren</EVENT> arabera, <EVENT eid="e35" class="OCCURRENCE">funtzio</EVENT> sistoliko egokia du ezker bentrikuluan, eta balbula aortikoaren <EVENT eid="e36" class="OCCURRENCE">estenosi</EVENT> arina.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e37" class="OCCURRENCE">Egoera</EVENT> funtzionalbasal egokia du, <EVENT eid="e38" class="OCCURRENCE">autonomoa</EVENT> da <TIMEX3 tid="t6" type="SET" value="P1D" temporalFunction="true">eguneroko</TIMEX3> oinarrizko <EVENT eid="e39" class="OCCURRENCE">zereginetan</EVENT>, eta <TIMEX3 tid="t7" type="DATE" value="PRESENT_REF" temporalFunction="true">orain</TIMEX3> arte esfortzu moderatuetako <EVENT eid="e40" class="OCCURRENCE">disnea</EVENT> baino ez du (N.Y.H.A-ko II. klase funtzionala).&#13;
<EVENT eid="e41" class="OCCURRENCE">Tratamenduan</EVENT>, hauekin: <EVENT eid="e42" class="OCCURRENCE">Ranitidina</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e43" class="OCCURRENCE">Metformina</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e44" class="OCCURRENCE">AAS</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e45" class="OCCURRENCE">Amlodipinoa</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e46" class="OCCURRENCE">Ezetimiba</EVENT>/Sinbastatina, <EVENT eid="e47" class="OCCURRENCE">Lorazepama</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e48" class="OCCURRENCE">hidroferola</EVENT>.&#13;
LARRIALDIETAKO ZERBITZUKO <EVENT eid="e49" class="OCCURRENCE">EBOLUZIOA</EVENT>&#13;
Pazientea larriealdietarra <EVENT eid="e50" class="OCCURRENCE">joaten</EVENT> da, aldapa bat <EVENT eid="e51" class="OCCURRENCE">igotzen</EVENT> ari den bitartean, bularreko <EVENT eid="e52" class="OCCURRENCE">mina</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e53" class="REPORTING">nabaritu</EVENT> ondoren, bat bateko <EVENT eid="e54" class="OCCURRENCE">sinkopea</EVENT> aurkeztu duelako, konortearen <EVENT eid="e55" class="OCCURRENCE">berreskuratze</EVENT> azkarrarekin, laguntzaileek <EVENT eid="e56" class="REPORTING">diotenez</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e57" class="OCCURRENCE">Iritisi</EVENT> denean, hemodinamikoki <EVENT eid="e58" class="OCCURRENCE">egonkor</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e59" class="OCCURRENCE">eupneiko</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e60" class="OCCURRENCE">sintomarik</EVENT> gabe aurkitzen da. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e61" class="OCCURRENCE">Behaketapean</EVENT> dagoen bitartean, ez du erritmoarean <EVENT eid="e62" class="OCCURRENCE">asaldurarik</EVENT> aurkeztu. &#13;
Kardiologian <EVENT eid="e63" class="OCCURRENCE">ingresatzea</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e64" class="OCCURRENCE">erabakitzen</EVENT> da, <EVENT eid="e65" class="OCCURRENCE">sinkope</EVENT> kardiologikoa izan daitekeen susmoarekin.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e66" class="OCCURRENCE">MIAKETA</EVENT> OSAGARRIAK:&#13;
<EVENT eid="e67" class="OCCURRENCE">EKG</EVENT>: minutuko 85 taupadako erritmo sinusala, ezker bentrikuluaren <EVENT eid="e68" class="OCCURRENCE">hazkundearekin</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e69" class="OCCURRENCE">Analitika</EVENT>: giltzurrun <EVENT eid="e70" class="OCCURRENCE">gutxiegitasun</EVENT> arina, ioien <EVENT eid="e71" class="OCCURRENCE">asaldurarik</EVENT> gabe. &#13;
Hemoglobina11.2g/dl, <EVENT eid="e72" class="OCCURRENCE">plaketopenia</EVENT> eta <EVENT eid="e73" class="OCCURRENCE">leukozitosirik</EVENT> gabe.&#13;
Toraxeko <EVENT eid="e74" class="OCCURRENCE">erradiografia</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e75" class="OCCURRENCE">kardiomegaliarik</EVENT> ez.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e76" class="OCCURRENCE">SUSMO</EVENT> DIAGNOSTIKOA&#13;
<EVENT eid="e77" class="OCCURRENCE">Kardiopatia</EVENT> iskemikoa eta balbularra duen paziente urtetsu eta pluripatologiko batek, <EVENT eid="e78" class="OCCURRENCE">sinkope</EVENT> susmagarria aurkeztu du.&#13;
</TEXT>
